Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, qt6-svg, qt6-sensors, qt6-wayland, kf6-bluezqt, kf6-config, kf6-configwidgets, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-globalaccel, kf6-i18n, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-jobwidgets, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-notifications, kf6-package, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, kwayland, kwin, libplasma, plasma-workspace, plasma-nano, plasma5support, plasma-pa
Description: First-light Plasma Mobile shell data for Xios
 Plasma Mobile provides the mobile look-and-feel, shell package, private mobile
 shell QML plugin family, containment plugins, quicksetting package data, and
 session entry files for the KDE mobile flavor.
 .
 This iOS bring-up package is intentionally trimmed to the shell path. Hardware
 settings, KCMs, KWin effects, modem/network backends, and device service
 bridges are deferred until their support packages are ready.
